                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>The Subscription Cohort Graphic, also known as, Subscriber&apos;s Retention Graphic helps tracking what happened to the subscribers after they&apos;ve entered the subscription program. The vertical column at the left &apos;Subscription Month&apos; represents the month a customer subscribed to the program, and the horizontal column at the top represents the subsequent months after that subscription. It&apos;s expected to see a decrease from left to right, as some customers leave the subscription program.</run>
