                <zone h='91523' id='3' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98482' x='759' y='7287'>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13030' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98482' x='759' y='7287'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>Those graphics will show a mix of two metrics, the Subscription Cohort and the Success Rate per User. The top graphic shows the Success Rate in green and red bars, and the area behind represents the amount of subscribers. The graphic at the bottom shows the same information, but in a different form, the amount of subscribers are represented by the blue bars, and the Success Rate is represented by a green line. Please note that each &apos;Subscription Month&apos; should be preferably analyzed separately, and therefore there are filters available for you to work with, whereas the &apos;Subsequent Months&apos; to the &apos;Subscription Month&apos; are always there so that you can keep track of the development.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
