        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='46694' id='5' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98698' x='651' y='6354'>
            <zone h='46694' id='3' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98698' x='651' y='6354'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='27042' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98698' x='651' y='6354'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>Here is an overview of the 5 main KPIs behind the Subscription Program.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>1) </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>Average Retention Rate</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>: Takes an average of the last 12 months of the percentage of subscribers that continued with their subscription on their second month. For example, have a look at the Cohorts Graphic at the bottom, of all customers that subscribed in September 2019, 62% continued with their subscription in the subsequent month (October 2019)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>2) </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>SR per User</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>: This takes an average of the last 12 months of the Success Rate per User on their first month of subscription.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>3) </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>SR per Trx</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>: This KPI returns the SR per trx of the previous month, for example if we are in January, this will show us the SR per Trx of December.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>4) </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>Lost Subscribers</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>: Among all subscribers that left the Subscription Program in the previous month, this shows the amount that we lost due to online payment problems, the other part have canceled their subscription program proactively (for more details please refer to the Information page).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>5) </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>Missing Subscription Date</run>
                  <run fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='12'>: This is how much missing data we have in the field &apos;Subscription Date (udf4)&apos; in the previous month accross all entities.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='19652' id='14' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98698' x='651' y='33396'>
                <zone h='19643' id='18' name='KPI (cohort)' show-title='false' w='19772' x='651' y='33333'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
